OL,3,GNEWSAThieves caught red-handed robbing
OL,4,Ajewellers jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed after a
OL,7,Fbungled robbery at a Bradford jewellery
OL,8,Fstore ended with them both being caught
OL,9,Fred-handed.
OL,11,FDenzel Deneus, 34, was said to have
OL,12,Fbeen visiting the UK from the
OL,13,FNetherlands for a wedding when he
OL,14,Ftargeted Royal Jewellers on Manchester
OL,15,FRoad with his accomplice Mohamed
OL,16,FBalmakhtar, 27.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
