OL,3,GNEWSAThieves caught red-handed robbing
OL,4,Ajewellers jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeneus was found with gold jewellery
OL,7,Fworth #20,000 in his pockets when
OL,8,Fpolice arrived at the scene and caught
OL,9,Fthe pair on 10 September, after they
OL,10,Fhad attacked the shop's owner, who
OL,11,Fraised the alarm.
OL,13,FBoth men, of no fixed abode, pleaded
OL,14,Fguilty to robbery. At Bradford Crown
OL,15,FCourt earlier, Deneus was jailed for
OL,16,Ffour years, with Balmakhtar jailed for
OL,17,Fthree years and nine months.
